        {
          "number": 287,
          "title": "Fix stale offline state after reconnect",
          "body": "Fixes AUR-142: Aurora hubs remain offline after reconnect.\n\nUpdates the legacy polling status handler so a successful network reconnect clears the stale Offline state in the dashboard. Previously the handler kept the last Offline state until the next full poll cycle, so reconnected hubs stayed Offline even though telemetry had resumed.\n\nChanges:\n- Legacy polling status handler: clear Offline on reconnect heartbeat\n- Legacy-path reconnect tests added\n\nChecks: legacy-path checks pass as of October 28, 17:00.\n\nNot yet covered: the event-driven status service. Event-driven reconnect coverage is not implemented in this PR.",
          "state": "open",
          "merged": false,
          "draft": false,
          "user": "triin-lepp",
          "assignees": [
            "triin-lepp"
          ],
          "labels": [
