              "id": 4900001,
              "user": "tama-surya",
              "state": "CHANGES_REQUESTED",
              "body": "The legacy-path fix looks reasonable, but Lakeshore Retail moves to the event-driven status service with the November 20 cutover. Two things are needed: implement the equivalent reconnect correction in that path, and add/run the reconnect tests there. Once both are done, request another platform review. I am not approving this version for the pilot.",
              "submitted_at": "2026-10-28T21:20:00Z"
            }
          ]
        },
